Subject: [202605] Restore Edgecore PDDF health and LED APIs

Port the minimal chassis LED methods and matching lowercase LED labels
from Edgecore AS7326/AS7726 (d39662e996c0e8748c9b96ad88dc5f5f524e8048),
also repairing the same PDDF gap on AS7816. AS5835 uses a native API
whose existing LED methods/configuration are retained. Preserve sensor
inventory, I2C registers, airflow handling and health ignore lists.
References: https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/pull/13809
https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/pull/23737

Verified source: 5ef9e45ccf7f004fb07bf3f9be2f471cf00573bf.
Remove individual fixes when upstream supplies equivalent behavior.
Software regressions cover these changes; only AS7326 has been
inspected live. Other models require installation/hardware validation.

